--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 88201f4f4f3247558c87e55aa4fb8ac4, type: 3}
  m_Name: WendellFirst
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: HiddenHarbours.World::HiddenHarbours.World.DialogueDef
  Id: dialogue.wendell_first
  FirstLines:
  - 'Wendell Arsenault. That''s my truck, that''s my ice, and I''ll take whatever''s fresh off you — clams, cod, don''t much matter, it all goes in the same box.'
  - 'Word of advice, since you''re new and I''m not busy. The counter up at St Peters will buy off you too. They''ll pay you less for it, and they''ll be pleasant about it, and you''ll thank them.'
  - 'Out here I''m not pleasant, but I pay dockside. That''s the whole of the difference and it''s worth the walk across the bar.'
  RepeatLines:
  - 'Let''s see it, then. Fresh is fresh and I''ve not got all tide.'
  Options:
  - Id: option.sell_pail
    Label: 'Here. What''ll you give me for this pail?'
    ReplyLines:
    - '₲{payout}, dockside, and you''re holding the pail again. Same box as everything else.'
    - 'Bring it back full on the next tide. I''ll be here, and I''ll still not be pleasant.'
    CatalogSellerId:
    CatalogSection:
    SellAtSellerId: seller.nmc_wharf_market
    NothingToSellLines:
    - 'That pail''s empty. I don''t pay for air, not even dockside.'
